9: 655&#x2013;675.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4149029</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25197452</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Westman, S. , Chandolias, K. , and Taherzadeh, M. (2016) Syngas biomethanation in a semi&#x2010;continuous reverse membrane bioreactor (RMBR). Fermentation 2: 8.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Whitman, W.B. , Bowen, T.L. , and Boone, D.R. (2006) The methanogenic bacteria In The Prokaryotes. Dworkin M., Falkow S., Rosenberg E., Schleifer K.H. and Stackebrandt E. (eds). New York, NY: Springer, pp. 165&#x2013;207.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>

