. J Microbiol Methods 94(3): 224-231.
</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">23806694</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Tuomivirta T. T., Yrjala K. and Fritze H.(2009). 
